<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχθρ-αίνω</span></b> , impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤχθραινον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					11.5
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤχθρηνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.
					67
				</span></i>
			, -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱνα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.394
			</span></i>; later form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχθαίρω</span>
			(q.v.): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχθρός</span>):—
			<i>hate</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span> X.l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.297
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐχθράναντες</span>
			<i>one's enemies</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				394
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mort.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινί</span>
			<i>to be at enmity with</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				25.18
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				5.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make hateful</i> or <i>hostile</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινι</span> Max.l.c.</div>
